    "text": "The reversible expansion of an ideal gas under adiabatic and isothermal conditions is shown in the figure. Which of the following statement is incorrect?<br />\r<br />\r<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/dykqiooxrymwvcmdqvtsqlnivkganwnfwsdkgsdyzeiewlqptr.jpeg\" style=\"height: 154px; width: 230px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
