  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "In an isothermal process, temperature is constant<br/><br/> <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> <br/><br/>Area under P - V graph is more is isothermal<br/><br/> <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></mrow><mrow><mtext>isothermal</mtext></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow><mrow><mtext>adiabatic</mtext></mrow></msub></math> <br/><br/>Now  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi></mrow><mrow><mtext>isothermal</mtext></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mn>0</mn></math> <br/><br/>In adiabatic  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">γ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">γ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> <br/><br/>  <math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">γ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> <br/><br/> <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math>  Hence internal energy decreases<br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi></mrow><mrow><mtext>isothermal</mtext></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi></mrow><mrow><mtext>adiabatic</mtext></mrow></msub></math>",
